        "_doc": "Arrows and bolts (systems/arms.js): a bowman (archer, longbowman; a scout issued a bow) carries a quiver of arrows, a crossbowman (or anyone issued a crossbow) bolts: unit.ammo, filled from the packs (every day, and after a battle) and, when he is recruited where the town sells them, bought at its price. Every battle (the auto battle, the phased field battle, the battlefield on the ground) he looses perBattle (on the battlefield: fieldVolley per volley his company looses); a won field gives back recover of what was loosed (picked up off the ground, into the packs). Short of a battle's worth he fights weaker: his worth x (dryMult + (1 - dryMult) x quiver / perBattle). A unit with no quiver record (an older save, a recruit who came with his own) is filled once, free. goods: the ammunition by weapon class.",
